nodes.body:
@zyongye @GirasoleY  Could you please take a look when you have time?

This PR fixes the precedence of the explicit fi_allreduce_fusion_max_size_mb override for standalone FlashInfer all-reduce. It is a small follow-up to #53318: topology-tuned defaults remain unchanged unless the user explicitly configures a limit.

The focused tests pass locally, and the PR includes H200 TP8 operator and end-to-end validation results.

